lucid-tokens (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release. Two binary packages: lucid-tokens for the command
    line, and liblucid-tokens-dev for the header and a static library.
  * The library is the point. lucid-bar and lucid-panel vendored this as a
    git submodule and compiled tokens.cpp straight in, so changing a default
    meant rebuilding and re-uploading both consumers. They can build against
    it now.
  * Static rather than shared while the interface is still moving. A shared
    object is a promise about an ABI and this one is not ready to make it.

 -- Javid Medina <javidamedina@gmail.com>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 04:40:00 -0400
